  <section id="temporal-patterns">
    <h2>Temporal Patterns &amp; Decade-by-Decade Breakdown</h2>
    <p>The distribution of wins over time reveals a push and pull between concentration and dispersion. Some decades are dominated by a few prolific composers, while others showcase remarkable diversity. The following chart shows the number of unique composers per decade, alongside the total ceremonies held.</p>

